<h2>Routing</h2>
<p>I’ll quickly touch upon core <code>http</code> module routing since we will read these routes in detail when we get on the express.js topic.</p>
<p>Routing is nothing but letting users redirect from one page to another. It also helps to divide code into authorized vs. non-authorized pages.</p>
